        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s7"
      },
      "text": "Hillary for America The Hillary for America presidential campaign owns the hillaryclinton.com domain, which is used for the campaign website (www.hillaryclinton.com) and for email addresses used by campaign staff.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_8",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Secureworks_TG-4127Clinton(06-16-2016)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s8"
      },
      "text": "An examination of the hillaryclinton.com DNS records shows that the domain's MX records, which indicate the mail server used by the domain, point to aspmx.l.google.com, the mail server used by Google Apps .",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_9",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Secureworks_TG-4127Clinton(06-16-2016)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s9"
      },
      "text": "TG-4127 exploited the Hillary for America campaign's use of Gmail and leveraged campaign employees' expectation of the standard Gmail login page to access their email account.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_10",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Secureworks_TG-4127Clinton(06-16-2016)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s10"
      },
      "text": "When presented with TG-4127's spoofed login page (see Figure 1), victims might be convinced it was the legitimate login page for their hillaryclinton.com email account.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_11",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Secureworks_TG-4127Clinton(06-16-2016)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s1"
      },
      "text": "CTU researchers observed the first short links targeting hillaryclinton.com email addresses being created in mid- March 2016; the last link was created in mid-May.",
